Dates:
    the past start tag should be yellow @start(2024-01-01)
    the past start tag with a time should be yellow @start(2024-01-01 12:30)
    the future start tag should be light purple @start(2099-12-31)
    the invalid start tag should be red and underlined @start(not-a-date)
    the start tag without an argument should be red and underlined @start
    the past due tag should be red @due(2024-01-01)
    the future due tag should be light purple @due(2099-12-31)
    the invalid due tag should be red and underlined @due(not-a-date)
    the due tag without an argument should be red and underlined @due

Repeat:
    the valid repeat tag should be orange @repeat(0 0 * * *)
    the invalid repeat tag should be red and underlined @repeat(not-a-cron)
    the repeat tag without an argument should be red and underlined @repeat

Tags:
    the queue tag should be yellow @queue(1)
    the queue tag should be light purple @queue(2)
