    this line should be gray @hide
    the line should be all gray with no inner colors @done @queue(1)

Decorations:
    the bold span should be red and bold **bold**
    the italic span should be italic *italic*
    the code span should be orange `code`
    the link should render as a link <https://example.com>
    the adjacent bold and italic spans should keep their colors **bold** *italic*
    the unclosed bold marker should stay plain **unclosed
    this done line should be all gray with no inner colors **bold** @done

